{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "solid of revolution: the region between x^2 and the x-axis about the x-axis\n  note: about the x-axis (say about y, about y = 2, about x = -1 for another)\n  x in [0, 1]: given\n  method: disks, V = pi ∫ (x^2)^2 dx from 0 to 1\n    antiderivative of the integrand: x^5/5\n    exact: V = 0.628318530717959 = pi/5\n    numeric (Gauss-Kronrod): 0.628318530717959, estimated error 6.9e-15\n    the two agree to 8.7e-17\n  check: shells in the radius on a grid: V ≈ 0.628322 (relative difference 6e-06, the grid's resolution)\n  volume: pi/5 = 0.6283 (exact)\n  region: area 1/3 = 0.3333, centroid (3/4 = 0.75, 3/10 = 0.3) (exact)\n  Pappus: V = 2pi d A, d = 3/10 = 0.3 from the centroid to the axis: 0.6283 (agrees)\n  surface area (the curves swept around the x-axis, without the end disks):\n    x^2: S = 2pi ∫ |x^2| sqrt(1 + (2x)^2) dx\n      exact: 3.8097297048578\n      numeric: 3.8097297048578, estimated error 4.2e-14\n  the region sweeps from 0 to 2pi in 36 steps\n  animation: 600x500, 37 frames (5.2 s), 206464 bytes\n  (nofile: GIF checksum d870e43c)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "revolve", "ucas": "revolve x^2 from 0 to 1 nofile", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "revolve", "volume": {"value": 0.6283185307179586, "exact": "pi/5", "is_exact": true}, "region_area": {"value": 0.3333333333333333, "exact": "1/3", "is_exact": true}, "centroid": {"x": {"value": 0.75, "exact": "3/4", "is_exact": true}, "y": {"value": 0.30000000000000004, "exact": "3/10", "is_exact": true}}, "surface_area": {"value": 3.8097297048578036, "is_exact": true}, "method": "disks, V = pi ∫ (x^2)^2 dx from 0 to 1", "antiderivative_of_the_integrand": "x^5/5", "exact": ["V = 0.628318530717959 = pi/5", "3.8097297048578"], "numeric_gauss_kronrod": "0.628318530717959, estimated error 6.9e-15", "region": "area 1/3 = 0.3333, centroid (3/4 = 0.75, 3/10 = 0.3) (exact)", "pappus": "V = 2pi d A, d = 3/10 = 0.3 from the centroid to the axis: 0.6283 (agrees)", "x_2": "S = 2pi ∫ |x^2| sqrt(1 + (2x)^2) dx", "numeric": "3.8097297048578, estimated error 4.2e-14", "animation": "600x500, 37 frames (5.2 s), 206464 bytes", "headline": "solid of revolution: the region between x^2 and the x-axis about the x-axis", "details": ["x in [0, 1]: given", "the two agree to 8.7e-17", "surface area (the curves swept around the x-axis, without the end disks):", "the region sweeps from 0 to 2pi in 36 steps", "(nofile: GIF checksum d870e43c)"]}, "notes": [{"kind": "info", "text": "about the x-axis (say about y, about y = 2, about x = -1 for another)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "shells in the radius on a grid: V ≈ 0.628322 (relative difference 6e-06, the grid's resolution)"}], "files": [], "text": "solid of revolution: the region between x^2 and the x-axis about the x-axis\n  note: about the x-axis (say about y, about y = 2, about x = -1 for another)\n  x in [0, 1]: given\n  method: disks, V = pi ∫ (x^2)^2 dx from 0 to 1\n    antiderivative of the integrand: x^5/5\n    exact: V = 0.628318530717959 = pi/5\n    numeric (Gauss-Kronrod): 0.628318530717959, estimated error 6.9e-15\n    the two agree to 8.7e-17\n  check: shells in the radius on a grid: V ≈ 0.628322 (relative difference 6e-06, the grid's resolution)\n  volume: pi/5 = 0.6283 (exact)\n  region: area 1/3 = 0.3333, centroid (3/4 = 0.75, 3/10 = 0.3) (exact)\n  Pappus: V = 2pi d A, d = 3/10 = 0.3 from the centroid to the axis: 0.6283 (agrees)\n  surface area (the curves swept around the x-axis, without the end disks):\n    x^2: S = 2pi ∫ |x^2| sqrt(1 + (2x)^2) dx\n      exact: 3.8097297048578\n      numeric: 3.8097297048578, estimated error 4.2e-14\n  the region sweeps from 0 to 2pi in 36 steps\n  animation: 600x500, 37 frames (5.2 s), 206464 bytes\n  (nofile: GIF checksum d870e43c)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       3      145      464   <- animated\n    Blelloch            7      294      358\n    sequential          7      110      110\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        7 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..51.375\n    d=2        6 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 51.375..102.75\n    d=4        4 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge  t = 102.75..145\n  result: 1 3 6 10 15 21 28 36\n  animation: 420x242, 225 frames at 30 fps (6.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 24.2 cost units; 236204 bytes\n  (nofile: GIF checksum 8ed8ac69)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "animate", "ucas": "animate scan n 8 nofile", "structured": false, "result": {"text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       3      145      464   <- animated\n    Blelloch            7      294      358\n    sequential          7      110      110\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        7 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..51.375\n    d=2        6 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 51.375..102.75\n    d=4        4 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge  t = 102.75..145\n  result: 1 3 6 10 15 21 28 36\n  animation: 420x242, 225 frames at 30 fps (6.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 24.2 cost units; 236204 bytes\n  (nofile: GIF checksum 8ed8ac69)\n"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis